{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37752","headline":"春暮咏怀寄集贤韦起居衮 · 郑谷","name":"春暮咏怀寄集贤韦起居衮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寂风帘信自垂，杨花笋箨正离披。\n长安一夜残春雨，右省三年老拾遗。\n坐看羣贤争得路，退量孤分且吟诗。\n五湖烟网非无意，未去难忘国士知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37752.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37752","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}